	(text "AD9833 60 Hz sine -> OPA1655 gain stage -> AD5453 VREF. The 14-bit MDAC sets the amplitude: VOUT = -VREF x code / 16384. OPA188 is its output stage. Zero scale at power-on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
